<title>USA: U.S. meat output 1.0 pct above a week ago - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output 1.0 pct above a week ago - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, March 29, rose 1.0 at 799.4 million lbs.</p>
<p>- USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>29-Mar-97	449.4     6.5	 338.6     4.9	799.4</p>
<p>22-Mar-97	443.3     6.6	 334.7     6.5	791.1</p>
<p>Change:	    1.4%   -1.5%	  1.2%  -24.6%	1.0%</p>
<p>30-Mar-96	448.2     6.6	 327.2     7.1	789.1</p>
<p>Change:	    0.3%   -1.5%	  3.5%  -31.0%	1.3%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:     5896.3    81.8	4071.8    63.8    10113.7</p>
<p>1996 YTD:     6165.4    87.9	4312.7    72.3    10638.3</p>
<p>Change:	   -4.4%   -6.9%	 -5.6%  -11.8%     -4.9%</p>
