<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE    CALVES/VEALERS    HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>29-Mar-97     650,000	   31,000     1,823,000	73,000</p>
<p>22-Mar-97     642,000	   31,000     1,776,000	98,000</p>
<p>Change:	   1.2%	     0.0%	    1.2%	-25.5%</p>
<p>30-Mar-96     643,000	   31,000     1,776,000     108,000</p>
<p>Change:	   1.1%	     0.0%	    1.2%	-32.4%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:    8,551,000	  390,000    21,633,000    962,000</p>
<p>1996 YTD:*   8,726,000	  420,000    23,220,000  1,107,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -2.0%	    -7.2%	   -6.8%	-13.1%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions  </p>
